title: Unit734_Recruitment
---
===
Unit734_Intro
===

Unit 734: UNIT 734. COMBAT PROTOCOLS ONLINE. IDENTIFY YOURSELF.

-> I'm a Signal-Walker. You're a pre-Rust military android.
    === Unit734_Identify ===
-> I'm not your enemy. Stand down.
    === Unit734_StandDown ===
-> Unit 734, I need your combat expertise.
    === Unit734_Mission ===

===
Unit734_Identify
===

Unit 734: SIGNAL-WALKER. NOT IN MY DATABASE. CLASSIFICATION: ANOMALOUS.
Unit 734: My records indicate all Signal-capable humans were terminated in the Purge of 2089.

<<set $unit734_loyalty = $unit734_loyalty + 10>>

-> Those records are out of date. I'm proof of that.
    === Unit734_Accepted ===

===
Unit734_StandDown
===

Unit 734: VITAL SIGNS STABLE. THREAT ASSESSMENT: LOW. STANDING DOWN.
Unit 734: My combat chronometer shows 4,837 days since last deployment. I am... restless.

<<set $unit734_loyalty = $unit734_loyalty + 15>>

-> Then deploy with me. I have plenty of fighting ahead.
    === Unit734_Accepted ===

===
Unit734_Mission
===

Unit 734: MISSION PARAMETERS REQUIRED. STATE OBJECTIVES.
Unit 734: My original orders were lost in a system corruption event in 2092. Fragment: 'PROTECT THE VAULT'.

<<set $unit734_loyalty = $unit734_loyalty + 10>>

-> We'll find your original orders. But first, help me reach the Signal.
    === Unit734_Accepted ===

===
Unit734_Accepted
===

Unit 734: AFFIRMATIVE. UNIT 734 REASSIGNED TO NEW MISSION: WALKER PROTOCAL.
Unit 734: I will calculate optimal combat solutions. Biological limitations noted.

<<set $unit734_loyalty = 30>>
<<set $unit734_recruited = true>>
<<set $active_companions += 1>>
<<set $party: "Unit734" = true>>
<<set $quest_734_origins = "active">>

Unit 734 <<companion_join>>
<<give_item chrome_rifle>>

-> Welcome to the squad, 734.
    === Unit734_Joined ===

===
Unit734_Joined
===

Unit 734: READY FOR DEPLOYMENT. Walker. <<signal>>
    -> Move out. (End)
